          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No places yet — photos with a location appear here as analysis runs.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun lieu pour l’instant — les photos géolocalisées apparaîtront ici au fil de l’analyse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No presets yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun préréglage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No saved versions": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune version enregistrée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No tags": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune étiquette"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No. Muse reads your files where they live and never writes over them. Photo edits are stored as instructions, not baked into the file, so the original is always intact. Deleting means moving to the Trash, and it's undoable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non. Muse lit vos fichiers là où ils se trouvent et ne les écrase jamais. Les retouches sont enregistrées sous forme d'instructions, et non intégrées au fichier : l'original reste toujours intact. Supprimer signifie mettre à la corbeille, et c'est annulable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noise Reduction": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réduction du bruit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune pour l'instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas maintenant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not downloaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non téléchargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not located": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non localisé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not located yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas encore localisé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not signed in": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non connecté"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not translated": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non converti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not unless you ask. Muse collects nothing — no analytics, no telemetry, no accounts — and nothing about you or your files ever reaches its makers. Sharing a collection uploads to your own Google Drive, only when you press Publish, and only ever touches the files it created there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas sans votre accord. Muse ne collecte rien — aucune analyse, aucune télémétrie, aucun compte — et rien vous concernant, vous ou vos fichiers, ne parvient à ses créateurs. Le partage d'une collection téléverse vers votre propre Google Drive, uniquement lorsque vous appuyez sur Publier, et ne touche jamais que les fichiers qu'il y a créés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note copiée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is clipping.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun écrêtage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing on disk changes — it just leaves the sidebar. Its index data is kept for 180 days, so re-adding it restores your tags, ratings and collections instantly, then it's cleaned up automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien ne change sur le disque — le dossier quitte simplement la barre latérale. Ses données d'index sont conservées 180 jours : le rajouter restaure instantanément vos tags, notes et collections, puis elles sont effacées automatiquement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to export.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien à exporter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to import": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien à importer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to save yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien à enregistrer pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
